## 3. Exercises

Exercise descriptions, explanatory text and pedagogical material are part of
the editorial content of the book and remain protected by copyright.

Source code created independently by readers while solving the exercises
belongs to its respective author.

Reference implementations provided in this repository are licensed under the
MIT License unless explicitly stated otherwise.

