## 4. Figures

Figures generated exclusively from source code in this repository may contain
two components:

1. the code used to generate them, licensed under the MIT License;
2. the resulting graphical composition, which may form part of the editorial
   content of the book.

Unless a figure contains a separate license notice, publication-quality
figures used in the book remain protected as editorial content.

