## 7. Academic use and citation

Academic use of the repository is encouraged.

When using source code, models, experiments or substantial methodological
material from this project in academic work, please cite the book or the
repository.

Citation information will be updated when the book receives its definitive
publication metadata, such as ISBN or DOI.

